== Effect ==
* Spawns 3 random [[card]]s.

== Notes ==
* Being a [[special card]], '''Ancient Recall''' has a significantly lower chance of appearing compared to other cards.
* Special "cards" like {{p|Cracked Key}} and {{p|Dice Shard}} can be spawned, but runes cannot spawn.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.

== Trivia ==
* Ancient Recall has been added in [[Booster Pack #1]], after the initial release of the DLC.
* Ancient Recall is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=841401139 this Steam Workshop mod] by aeiou.
* Ancient Recall is a reference to the card [http://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=95 Ancestral Recall] from Magic: The Gathering.
* {{dlc+|r}} Prior to patch v1.7.7 of ''Repentance'', it was possible to spawn infinite cards with this card and {{I|Echo Chamber}}.{{dlc-}}

